| Port                | Direction | Role                                                                       |
| ------------------- | --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `clk`               | Input     | FPGA system clock; controls the FSM                                        |

| `rst_n`             | Input     | Active-low reset                                                           |

| `fft_frame_valid`   | Input     | Tells the controller that the FFT buffer has collected all 16 samples      |

| `buffer_data[11:0]` | Input     | **Actual 12-bit sample read from the FFT buffer**                          |

| `buffer_read_en`    | Output    | Tells the FFT buffer: **"Give me the sample."**                            |

| `buffer_addr[3:0]`  | Output    | Selects which buffer location to read: `0 → 15`                            |

| `fft_start`         | Output    | Tells the FFT processing section that the complete frame has been supplied |

| `fft_valid`         | Output    | Indicates that the current `buffer_data` is valid for FFT processing       |














